    - target: {fileID: 5409347060910762992, guid: d194763b30d9fc446abc1b342b36366e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\nHello there!\n\nWelcome to a city where taxes have been\u2026 neglected
        for far too long. You\u2019re here to fix that and bring some financial order.
        \n\nYour mission: learn about your taxpayers and make sure they pay every
        last coin they owe to society!\n\nTake a moment to explore your tools:\nOn
        the left, you\u2019ll find all the records you need. Fill them in carefully!\n
        - Check restaurants for market prices.\n - Visit the work office for salary
        updates.\n\nOn the right, meet your trusty Taxulator 3000 \u2014 the ultimate
        calculation machine!\n\nAnd finally, keep an eye on the clock at the bottom:
        you\u2019ve got 10 days to make sure everyone contributes\u2026 generously."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5409347060910762992, guid: d194763b30d9fc446abc1b342b36366e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_lineSpacing
